// are added back. Every term of the estimate then belongs to the same moment.
// Counting today's clears here while the anchor still sat on yesterday made the
// date creep closer through the day and then snap back a day at midnight, when
// the anchor caught up: the learner was shown a reward in the afternoon and
// charged for it overnight, having in fact done nothing but study.
// The work left as it stood at the end of the anchor day.
