// assignment: WebKit gates this whole API on the MICROPHONE permissions-policy
// feature (DOMAudioSession::setType returns early when it is disallowed) and
// refuses in silence, leaving the getter answering 'auto'. Our own .htaccess
// sent microphone=(), being an app that never records, so the Settings option
// could not work whatever it set. Reading the value back is what turned that
// from a mystery into one line of output, and it is why this is a report
// rather than a boolean.
