// is clipped when the text ends abruptly. Giving the engine a little to run
// past fixes it: a terminal period (the bank's statements carry none, so this
// also supplies the falling intonation of a finished sentence) plus trailing
// spaces as a short tail. Purely acoustic padding, never shown to the user.
